# Flutter Attendance Mobile App — Implementation Plan

Build a production-ready Flutter mobile app that integrates with the existing BAIS Laravel backend, matching the Figma design precisely across 6 screens.

## API Contract Summary (existing backend)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Body / Params |
|--------|----------|------|---------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Public | [login](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Auth/Controllers/AuthController.php#23-39) or `email`, [password](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Auth/Requests/LoginRequest.php#63-67), `device_identifier`, `device_name` |
| POST | `/api/auth/change-password` | Bearer | `current_password`, `new_password` |
| POST | `/api/attendance/check-in` | Bearer | `branch_id`, [latitude](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceCheckInRequest.php#30-34), [longitude](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceCheckInRequest.php#35-39) |
| POST | `/api/attendance/check-out` | Bearer | `branch_id` |
| GET | `/api/attendance/history` | Bearer | [from](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceHistoryRequest.php#27-33), [to](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Leaves/Controllers/LeaveRequestController.php#44-52), [status](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceHistoryRequest.php#41-47), `branch_id`, `per_page` |
| GET | `/api/shifts` | Bearer | — |
| GET | `/api/leaves/balance` | Bearer | `year` |
| GET | `/api/leaves/requests` | Bearer | — |
| POST | `/api/leaves/requests` | Bearer | `leave_type`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `reason` |
| GET | `/api/employees` | Bearer | — |

---

## Proposed Changes

### [NEW] Flutter Project — `d:\Projects\BAIS\mobile`

#### Project Structure
```
mobile/
├── lib/
│   ├── main.dart                          # App entry + providers
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── api_config.dart                # Base URL, timeout constants
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── user.dart                      # User + Employee merged model
│   │   ├── attendance_log.dart            # AttendanceLog model
│   │   ├── shift.dart                     # Shift model
│   │   ├── branch.dart                    # Branch model (lat/lng/radius)
│   │   └── leave_request.dart             # LeaveRequest model
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── api_service.dart               # HTTP client with Sanctum Bearer tokens
│   │   ├── auth_service.dart              # Login, token storage, logout
│   │   ├── attendance_service.dart        # Check-in/out, history
│   │   ├── shift_service.dart             # Fetch shifts
│   │   └── leave_service.dart             # Balance, create/list requests
│   ├── providers/
│   │   ├── auth_provider.dart             # Auth state (ChangeNotifier)
│   │   ├── attendance_provider.dart       # Attendance state
│   │   └── leave_provider.dart            # Leave state
│   ├── screens/
│   │   ├── login_screen.dart              # Employee ID + Password login
│   │   ├── dashboard_screen.dart          # Home with shift timer, check-in, map
│   │   ├── schedule_screen.dart           # Calendar week strip + shift cards
│   │   ├── history_screen.dart            # Month/status filter + log cards
│   │   ├── leave_screen.dart              # Balance + leave request form
│   │   └── profile_screen.dart            # Employee info
│   ├── widgets/
│   │   ├── bottom_nav_bar.dart            # 5-tab bottom navigation
│   │   ├── shift_countdown.dart           # Circular countdown timer
│   │   ├── weekly_summary_card.dart       # Hours worked + days present
│   │   ├── attendance_card.dart           # History log card
│   │   ├── schedule_card.dart             # Shift card for schedule
│   │   └── leave_balance_card.dart        # Annual/Sick leave cards
│   └── theme/
│       └── app_theme.dart                 # Colors, typography, component themes
├── pubspec.yaml
└── android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml  # Permissions
```

---

### 1. Core Layer

#### [NEW] `api_config.dart`
- `baseUrl` constant (configurable, defaults to `http://10.0.2.2:8000/api` for emulator)

#### [NEW] `api_service.dart`
- Singleton HTTP client using `http` package
- Auto-attach `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
- JSON request/response helpers (`get`, `post`, `put`, `delete`)
- Token stored/loaded from `SharedPreferences`

#### [NEW] Models (`user.dart`, `attendance_log.dart`, `shift.dart`, `branch.dart`, `leave_request.dart`)
- `fromJson` factories matching exact Laravel response shapes
- `toJson` for request payloads

---

### 2. Auth Flow

#### [NEW] `auth_service.dart`
- [login(login, password, deviceIdentifier, deviceName)](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Auth/Controllers/AuthController.php#23-39) → POST `/auth/login`
- Store token + user in SharedPreferences
- `logout()` → clear token

#### [NEW] `auth_provider.dart` (ChangeNotifier)
- `isAuthenticated`, [user](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Models/AttendanceLog.php#42-46), `token`
- Auto-load token on app start
- Notify listeners on login/logout

#### [NEW] `login_screen.dart`
Design from Figma:
- Bank icon + "Employee Login" title
- Employee ID field (prefixed icon)
- Password field (with visibility toggle)
- "Forgot Password?" link
- Blue "Secure Login" button
- "ALTERNATIVE ACCESS" divider + Biometric Login button
- "Device Authorized" chip at bottom
- "Real-time Sync Active" status indicator

---

### 3. Dashboard Screen

#### [NEW] `dashboard_screen.dart`
Design from Figma:
- **App bar**: Avatar + "Dashboard" + notification bell
- **Greeting card** (dark blue): role, "Good Morning, Name", shift start info, "On Time" badge
- **Shift section**: "Morning Shift 08:30 AM - 05:00 PM" + circular countdown timer
