### 5. History Screen

#### [NEW] `history_screen.dart`
Design from Figma:
- **App bar**: Avatar + "History" + notification bell
- **Filters row**: Month dropdown + Status dropdown
- **Attendance log cards** each showing:
  - Day of week + date (left column)
  - Shift type + branch name
  - Status badge (Present=green, Late=red, Half Day=orange)
  - Check In time, Check Out time, Total Hours

Calls `GET /attendance/history` with [from](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceHistoryRequest.php#27-33)/[to](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Leaves/Controllers/LeaveRequestController.php#44-52)/[status](file:///d:/Projects/BAIS/app/Modules/Attendance/Requests/AttendanceHistoryRequest.php#41-47) filters.

---

### 6. Leave Request Screen

#### [NEW] `leave_screen.dart`
Design from Figma:
- **App bar**: Avatar + "Leave Request" + notification bell
- **Balance cards**: Annual Leave (blue border) + Sick Leave (orange border) with days available
- **Leave form card**:
  - Leave Type dropdown (annual, sick, personal, other)
  - Start Date + End Date pickers
  - Total days calculated display
  - Reason textarea
  - Blue "Submit Request" button

Calls `GET /leaves/balance` for balances, `POST /leaves/requests` for submission.

